  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding from Alaska Medicaid Infliximab Criteria Version 1: Original 2/9/22; Approval 3/18/22; Effective 5/1/22. Covers Avsola, Inflectra, Remicade and Renflexis.",
    "FDA section biosimilar note: Avsola, Inflectra and Renflexis are biosimilars to Remicade; highly similar to the reference product with no clinically meaningful differences.",
    "Specialty gap: no prescriber specialty requirement in PDF. HS age not specified in PDF; no trial required for hidradenitis suppurativa (PDF spelling \u201cHydradenitis\u201d). No age or prior-therapy facts required for HS. Ages reflect this Alaska PDF.",
    "Duration (notes only): initial approval up to 6 months; reauthorization up to 12 months if prescriber documents disease improvement or stabilization.",
    "Quantity and dosing (manual review): adult and pediatric CD and UC: 5 mg/kg at weeks 0, 2 and 6, then every 8 weeks. Adult CD initial responders who later lose response may benefit from 10 mg/kg. RA: with methotrexate, 3 mg/kg at weeks 0, 2 and 6, then every 8 weeks; some may benefit from up to 10 mg/kg or as often as every 4 weeks. AS: 5 mg/kg at weeks 0, 2 and 6, then every 6 weeks. PsA and plaque psoriasis: 5 mg/kg at weeks 0, 2 and 6, then every 8 weeks. JIA and HS schedules are not specified. Weight-based limits are not numerically enforced; weight submission and HF dosing safety are encoded.",
    "HCPCS (notes only): Remicade J1745; Avsola Q5121; Inflectra Q5103; Renflexis Q5104.",
    "Cautions: see package inserts: Remicade https://www.janssenlabels.com/package-insert/product-monograph/prescribing-information/REMICADE-pi.pdf ; Avsola https://www.pi.amgen.com/~/media/amgen/repositorysites/pi-amgen-com/avsola/avsola_pi_english.ashx ; Inflectra https://labeling.pfizer.com/ShowLabeling.aspx?id=9271 ; Renflexis https://www.organon.com/product/usa/pi_circulars/r/renflexis/renflexis-pi.pdf",
    "PDL context: mixed product status; unbranded INFLIXIMAB (INJECTION) is preferred; AVSOLA, INFLECTRA, REMICADE and RENFLEXIS are non_preferred. Pack pdl_status is unknown because the schema does not support mixed. Linked alternatives require their own indication-specific review.",
    "This pack remains partial: duration, reauthorization response documentation, weight-based quantity schedules and package-insert cautions require manual review."
  ],
